---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Case Studies"
description: "Illustrative examples of how Rhemroyal Business Services engagements are designed to help startups, growing businesses and social initiatives."
navActive: case
permalink: "case-studies.html"
---
<div class="container breadcrumb"><a href="/index.html">Home</a><span>/</span>Case Studies</div>

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="eyebrow">CASE STUDIES</span>
    <h1>The work, and what clients say about it.</h1>
    <p class="lede">Feedback from the organisations and people we've worked with, photos from our sessions, and illustrative examples of how our engagements are designed to work.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section white" id="testimonials">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-heading"><span class="eyebrow">WHAT CLIENTS SAY</span><h2>In their words.</h2></div>
    <div class="testimonial-full-list">
      {% for t in testimonials.testimonials %}
      <article class="testimonial-full">
        {% for para in (t.fullQuote or t.quote) | paragraphs %}<p>{{ para }}</p>{% endfor %}
        <div class="testimonial-author"><div class="author-avatar">{{ t.initial }}</div><div><div class="author-name">{{ t.name }}</div><div class="author-role">{{ t.role }}</div></div></div>
        {% if t.isPlaceholder %}<span class="placeholder-tag">Sample testimonial — replace with a real quote</span>{% endif %}
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section cream" id="in-the-room">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-heading"><span class="eyebrow">IN THE ROOM</span><h2>Our work in action.</h2><p>Training sessions and conversations with the organisations we work with.</p></div>
    <div class="gallery-grid">
      {% for p in gallery.photos | limit(12) %}
      <figure class="gallery-item"><img src="{{ p.image }}" alt="{{ p.alt }}" width="1000" height="750" loading="lazy" />{% if p.caption %}<figcaption>{{ p.caption }}</figcaption>{% endif %}</figure>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section white" id="examples">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-heading"><span class="eyebrow">HOW ENGAGEMENTS PLAY OUT</span><h2>Illustrative examples.</h2><p>These scenarios are based on how our services are designed to work. They are not named client results.</p></div>
    <div class="case-grid">
    {% for c in caseStudies.caseStudies %}
    <article class="case-card">
      <div class="case-card-content">
        {% if c.isIllustrative %}<span class="case-tag">ILLUSTRATIVE EXAMPLE</span>{% endif %}
        <h3>{{ c.title }}</h3>
        <p><strong>Situation:</strong> {{ c.situation }}</p>
        <p><strong>Approach:</strong> {{ c.approach }}</p>
        <p class="case-quote">"{{ c.quote }}"</p>
      </div>
      <div class="case-card-results">
        {% for r in c.results %}
        <div class="case-result"><b>{{ r.stat }}</b><span>{{ r.label }}</span></div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </article>
    {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cta">
  <div class="container cta-inner">
    <div><span class="eyebrow light">WANT TO BE OUR NEXT STORY?</span><h2>Let's talk about what your engagement could look like.</h2></div>
    <a class="btn btn-light" href="/contact.html#book">Book a Consultation</a>
  </div>
</section>
